---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Kontakt — Objednajte si diagnostiku a servis" 
  description="Kontaktujte nezávislých špecialistov na fotovoltiku. Vyplňte kontaktný formulár a získajte cenovú ponuku na diagnostiku a servis vašej FVE."
>
  <main class="contact-page">
    <!-- Page Header Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <span class="badge badge-orange">Spojte sa s nami</span>
        <h1>Objednajte si kontrolu svojej FVE</h1>
        <p>Vyplňte formulár nižšie alebo nás kontaktujte telefonicky či e-mailom. Odpovieme vám do 24 hodín.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact details and form -->
    <section class="contact-section">
      <div class="bg-glow bg-glow-teal" style="top: 20%; left: -5%; opacity: 0.1;"></div>
      
      <div class="container grid-2">
        <!-- Left Column: Details & Coverage -->
        <div class="contact-details-col">
          <span class="badge badge-teal">Kontaktné údaje</span>
          <h2>Ako nás zastihnúť</h2>
          
          <div class="contact-info-cards">
            <!-- Card 1: Phone -->
            <div class="glass-panel info-item-card">
              <div class="info-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="info-content">
                <span>TELEFÓN</span>
                <a href="tel:+421900000000">+421 900 000 000</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Email -->
            <div class="glass-panel info-item-card">
              <div class="info-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="info-content">
                <span>E-MAIL</span>
                <a href="mailto:info@lvsun.sk">info@lvsun.sk</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Billing Info -->
          <div class="billing-box glass-panel">
            <h3>Fakturačné údaje</h3>
            <div class="billing-grid">
              <div>
                <strong>Spoločnosť:</strong>
                <p>LVsun s.r.o.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>Sídlo:</strong>
                <p>Ulica slnečnej energie 42, 811 01 Bratislava</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>IČO:</strong>
                <p>00 000 000</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>DIČ:</strong>
                <p>SK0000000000</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Coverage Map mockup -->
          <div class="coverage-box glass-panel">
            <h3>Pokrytie na celom Slovensku</h3>
            <p>Naša diagnostika a servis sú dostupné vo všetkých krajoch. Nezáleží na tom, kde sa vaša elektráreň nachádza.</p>
            <div class="coverage-tags">
              <span>Bratislavský kraj</span>
              <span>Trnavský kraj</span>
              <span>Trenčiansky kraj</span>
              <span>Nitriansky kraj</span>
              <span>Žilinský kraj</span>
              <span>Banskobystrický kraj</span>
              <span>Prešovský kraj</span>
              <span>Košický kraj</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Premium Form -->
        <div class="contact-form-col">
          <div class="glass-card form-card">
            <h2>Nezáväzný dopyt</h2>
            <p>Zadajte základné parametre elektrárne a my vám pripravíme predbežný návrh a cenovú ponuku.</p>
            
            <form class="lead-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Ďakujeme! Váš dopyt bol úspešne odoslaný. Ozveme sa vám v najbližšej dobe.');">
              <!-- Field: Name -->
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="name">Meno a priezvisko</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="Ján Kováč" />
              </div>

              <!-- Row: Phone & Email -->
              <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="phone">Telefónne číslo</label>
                  <input type="tel" id="phone" required placeholder="+421 900 000 000" />
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="email">E-mailová adresa</label>
                  <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="jan.kovac@example.com" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Row: Location & Type -->
              <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="location">Mesto / Obec (lokalita FVE)</label>
                  <input type="text" id="location" required placeholder="Žilina" />
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="fve-type">Typ elektrárne</label>
                  <select id="fve-type" required>
                    <option value="" disabled selected>Vyberte typ...</option>
                    <option value="rodinny-dom">Rodinný dom</option>
                    <option value="komercna-strecha">Komerčná strecha (Firma)</option>
                    <option value="komercna-pozemna">Pozemná elektráreň</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Field: Message -->
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="message">Poznámka / Popis problému (nepovinné)</label>
                <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="Napr. elektráreň vykazuje pokles výkonu približne o 20% oproti minulému roku, prípadne hlási chybu meniča..."></textarea>
              </div>

              <!-- Consent checkbox -->
              <div class="form-checkbox">
                <input type="checkbox" id="consent" required />
                <label for="consent">Súhlasím so <a href="#" class="inline-link">spracovaním osobných údajov</a> pre účely vypracovania ponuky.</label>
              </div>

              <!-- Submit button -->
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary submit-btn">Odoslať nezáväzný dopyt</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-page {
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding-top: 8rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-deep) 0%, var(--bg-dark) 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 3.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .page-hero p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* Contact section styles */
  .contact-section {
    padding: 7rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .contact-details-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .contact-details-col h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-info-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .info-item-card {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .info-item-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 240, 240, 0.05);
  }

  .info-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: hsla(180, 80%, 45%, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid hsla(180, 80%, 45%, 0.2);
    color: var(--secondary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .info-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .info-content span {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .info-content a {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .info-content a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Billing Box */
  .billing-box, .coverage-box {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .billing-box h3, .coverage-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .billing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .billing-grid strong {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .billing-grid p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Coverage Tags */
  .coverage-box p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .coverage-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .coverage-tags span {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* Premium Form styling */
  .contact-form-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .form-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(255, 150, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .form-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .lead-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .lead-form label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .lead-form input,
  .lead-form select,
  .lead-form textarea {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .lead-form input:focus,
  .lead-form select:focus,
  .lead-form textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--primary-glow);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .lead-form select option {
    background: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .form-checkbox {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-checkbox input {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .form-checkbox label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--secondary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .inline-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .submit-btn {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .contact-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .contact-details-col h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .form-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
